ion",overload:1,flavor:"Thor ne vise pas. Il désigne, et le ciel fait le reste."},{id:"thane.valkyrie",name:"Valkyrie de l’orage",type:"minion",rarity:"rare",cost:5,text:"Bouclier divin. Surcharge : (1).",effects:[],targeting:"none",overload:1,minion:{attack:6,health:6,keywords:["divineShield"]},flavor:"Elle choisit qui meurt au combat. Ce matin, elle a déjà rempli sa liste."},{id:"thane.shieldwallJarl",name:"Jarl du mur de boucliers",type:"minion",rarity:"rare",cost:5,text:"Provocation. Cri de guerre : tes autres serviteurs gagnent Provocation.",effects:[],targeting:"none",minion:{attack:5,health:7,keywords:["taunt"],battlecry:[{kind:"grantKeyword",keyword:"taunt"}]},flavor:"« Personne ne recule ! » Personne ne peut : ils sont tous collés les uns aux autres."},{id:"thane.frostGiant",name:"Géant de givre lié",type:"minion",rarity:"rare",cost:6,text:"Provocation. Cri de guerre : gagne 2 d’armure.",effects:[],targeting:"none",minion:{attack:5,health:8,keywords:["taunt"],battlecry:[{kind:"block",amount:2}]},flavor:"Enchaîné par des runes, il se bat pour Nordmark. Il préférerait l’écraser."},{id:"thane.thorsBlessing",name:"Bénédiction de Thor",type:"skill",rarity:"rare",cost:4,text:"Tes serviteurs gagnent +2/+2. Gagne 2 d’armure.",effects:[{kind:"buffMinions",attack:2,health:2},{kind:"block",amount:2}],targeting:"none",flavor:"Une tape de Thor sur l’épaule. Chaque guerrier a grandi d’une tête et perdu l’ouïe d’un côté."},{id:"thane.einherjarCaptain",name:"Capitaine des Einherjar",type:"minion",rarity:"epic",cost:7,text:"Cri de guerre : invoque deux Einherjar 2/2.",effects:[],targeting:"none",minion:{attack:6,health:8,battlecry:[{kind:"summon",card:"token.einherjar"},{kind:"summon",card:"token.einherjar"}]},flavor:"Mort trois fois, ressuscité trois fois au Valhalla. Il commence à y prendre goût."},{id:"thane.ragnarok",name:"Tempête de Ragnarök",type:"attack",rarity:"epic",cost:7,overload:2,text:"Inflige 5 dégâts à tous les ennemis. Surcharge : (2).",effects:[{kind:"damage",amount:5,target:"allEnemies"}],targeting:"allEnemies",flavor:"Le crépuscule des dieux. Un avant-goût."},{id:"thane.stormGiant",name:"Jötunn de la tempête",type:"minion",rarity:"epic",cost:8,text:"Cri de guerre : inflige 3 dégâts à tous les serviteurs ennemis. Surcharge : (2).",effects:[],targeting:"none",overload:2,minion:{attack:7,health:10,battlecry:[{kind:"damage",amount:3,target:"enemyMinions"}]},flavor:"Quand il éternue, Jötunheim prévient Nordmark : « Rentrez le linge et les enfants. »"},{id:"thane.mjolnir",name:"Mjöllnir",type:"weapon",rarity:"legendary",cost:7,text:"Arme. Inflige 2 dégâts à tous les serviteurs ennemis. Gagne 4 d’armure.",effects:[{kind:"damage",amount:2,target:"enemyMinions"},{kind:"block",amount:4}],targeting:"none",weapon:{attack:5,durability:3},flavor:"Le manche est trop court, disent les nains. Personne n’a jamais osé le dire à Thor."},{id:"thane.thor",name:"Thor, fils d’Odin",type:"minion",rarity:"legendary",cost:9,text:"Provocation. Cri de guerre : inflige 2 dégâts à un ennemi aléatoire quatre fois. Râle d’agonie : équipe Mjöllnir (5/3).",effects:[],targeting:"none",minion:{attack:7,health:7,keywords:["taunt"],battlecry:[{kind:"damageRandom",amount:2,hits:4}],deathrattle:[{kind:"equip",card:"thane.mjolnir"}]},flavor:"Dieu du tonnerre, protecteur de Nordmark, grand mangeur de chèvres."},{id:"thane.magni",name:"Magni, fils de Thor",type:"minion",rarity:"legendary",cost:8,text:"Ruée. Cri de guerre : invoque Modi 5/5 avec Provocation.",effects:[],targeting:"none",minion:{attack:7,health:7,keywords:["rush"],battlecry:[{kind:"summon",card:"token.thaneModi"}]},flavor:"À trois ans, il souleva la jambe du géant Hrungnir, tombée sur Thor. Aucun dieu n’y était parvenu, et il le leur rappelle souvent."}],tokens:[{id:"token.thaneModi",name:"Modi, fils de Thor",type:"minion",rarity:"common",cost:0,text:"Provocation.",effects:[],targeting:"none",minion:{attack:5,health:5,keywords:["taunt"]},flavor:"Le frère colérique. Après le Ragnarök, il devra partager Mjöllnir avec Magni."}],unlock:{condition:e=>(e.bossesKilled??0)>=2,fr:"Vaincs 2 boss d’acte (atteins l’acte 3), ou débloque-le pour 400 Or dans « Améliorations ».",en:"Defeat 2 act bosses (reach act 3), or unlock it for 400 Gold in “Upgrades”."},voice:{voiceId:"IKne3meq5aSn9XLyUdCD",start:["Thor, lend me your thunder!","Thor, prête-moi ton tonnerre !"],victory:["The storm has spoken. Nordmark stands!","L’orage a parlé. Nordmark tient bon !"],lowHp:["Not yet... the hammer still swings!","Pas encore… le marteau frappe toujours !"]},art:{subject:"Midgard thane: broad-shouldered norse warrior in heavy chainmail and a winged steel helm, red braided beard, round painted shield on the back, a great rune-carved war hammer crackling with blue lightning",kind:"warrior",seed:512,portraitSeed:1812,cardSeed:3100,cards:{"thane.hammerBlow":"a norse thane swinging a heavy war hammer into a troll’s shield, splinters and sparks flying, snowy battlefield","thane.chainmail":"a dwarf smith fitting a gleaming chainmail hauberk on a norse warrior in a forge lit by orange fire","thane.housecarl":"a stern norse housecarl bodyguard with a round shield and spear standing at a longhouse door, snow falling","thane.stormCaller":"a norse warrior raising a hammer to dark storm clouds as lightning strikes down around him, fjord behind","thane.lightning":"a single jagged bolt of blue lightning striking a frost giant from a black sky, blinding flash","thane.runeHammer":"a norse war hammer with glowing blue runes resting on an anvil in a dwarven forge, embers floating","thane.jarlsGuard":"a norse jarl’s guard with a battered painted round shield bristling with broken axes, standing firm","thane.thunderclap":"a norse thane slamming a hammer into the ground, a ring of blue thunder blasting enemies off their feet","thane.stormRider":"a norse rider on a black horse galloping across the sky through storm clouds, lightning trailing behind","thane.chainLightning":"blue chain lightning arcing between the helmets of three enemy warriors in a dark forest","thane.oakenShield":"a big round oak shield with iron rim and painted Midgard serpent emblem, arrows stuck in it, snowy ground","thane.oathOfThor":"a kneeling norse thane swearing an oath on a hammer before a stone altar of Thor, thunder in the sky","thane.stormJudgement":"a giant crackling bolt of lightning splitting a wooden fortress gate, a thane silhouetted in the flash","thane.frostGiant":"a towering frost giant bound by glowing rune chains fighting for norse warriors, icy blue skin, blizzard","thane.einherjarCaptain":"a battle-scarred einherjar captain with ghostly golden glow leading undead norse warriors out of Valhalla","thane.ragnarok":"the apocalyptic storm of Ragnarok over Midgard, burning sky, lightning, giant serpent rising from the sea","thane.mjolnir":"Mjolnir, the hammer of Thor, floating amid swirling lightning above a stormy mountain peak, glowing runes","thane.thor":"a mighty red-bearded norse storm warrior in a winged helm and red cape raising a glowing war hammer to a stormy sky, lightning all around","thane.thunderGoat":"a furious black mountain goat with curled horns crackling with blue sparks, charging down a snowy norse slope","thane.shieldMaiden":"a fierce norse shieldmaiden with blonde braids and a painted round shield bracing in a snowy village, spear raised","thane.runecaster":"an old norse runecaster carving glowing blue runes into a standing stone, sparks of lightning leaping from the chisel","thane.hammerThrow":"a norse thane hurling a spinning war hammer trailing lightning across a frozen battlefield at a fleeing troll","thane.shieldWall":"a tight wall of overlapping painted round shields held by norse warriors, spears bristling, arrows bouncing off, snowstorm","thane.thunderWarrior":"a huge norse warrior with hair standing on end, blue lightning crackling across his chainmail and twin hammers","thane.thunderDrums":"norse warriors pounding great skin war drums on a cliff above a fjord, storm clouds and lightning answering","thane.stormRiposte":"an enemy sword striking a norse thane’s shield, a burst of blue lightning blasting back into the attacker","thane.hammerDwarf":"a stocky dwarf smith with a braided beard swinging a glowing forge hammer in battle, sparks and embers flying","thane.valkyrie":"a winged valkyrie in silver armor diving from storm clouds on a white horse, spear crackling with lightning","thane.shieldwallJarl":"a grey-bearded norse jarl in a fur cloak commanding a shield wall, raising his axe, banners in the snow","thane.thorsWrath":"a colossal hand of lightning reaching down from black storm clouds to smite a monstrous troll, blinding blue light","thane.stormGiant":"a colossal storm giant of Jotunheim wreathed in black clouds, hurling lightning down onto a battlefield of tiny warriors","thane.stormSpirit":"a small furious storm spirit made of black clouds with crackling lightning fists, swirling above a snowy norse field","thane.deafeningThunder":"a stunned troll covered in frost sparks reeling from a deafening thunderclap, a norse thane with raised hammer behind","thane.jordheimHorn":"a norse warrior blowing a great curved war horn on the walls of Jordheim, two housecarls with round shields rushing out","thane.forgeHammer":"a dwarven smith quenching a glowing war hammer in snow under a lightning storm, steam and blue sparks rising","thane.hammerFury":"a roaring norse thane with eyes glowing blue, lightning coursing through his raised war hammer and chainmail, storm behind","thane.heimdallSentinel":"a towering norse sentinel in golden scale armor and horned helm guarding the shimmering Bifrost bridge of prismatic crystal light glowing softly like the aurora over the night sky of Asgard, horn at her belt","thane.thorsBlessing":"a giant ghostly hand of Thor wreathed in lightning blessing a line of norse warriors with round shields, golden glow, storm sky","thane.magni":"young red-haired Magni son of Thor lifting a huge glowing hammer, his scowling brother Modi with a shield beside him, lightning sky"}}},el={id:"wizard",name:"Thaumaturge",nameEn:"Wizard",realm:"albion",hp:26,startingRelic:"censer_ash",hook:"Feu et glace : boules de feu, colonnes de flammes, Gel, Dégâts des sorts et Secrets de la Tour d’Avalon.",heroPower:{id:"fireBolt",name:"Trait de feu",text:"Inflige 2 dégâts à un ennemi.",cost:2,targeting:"enemy",effects:[{kind:"damage",amount:2}]},starterDeck:["wizard.flameDart","wizard.flameDart","wizard.flameDart","wizard.frostWard","wizard.frostWard","wizard.frostWard","wizard.apprentice","wizard.apprentice","wizard.emberFamiliar","wizard.emberFamiliar"],cards:[{id:"wizard.flameDart",name:"Dard de flamme",type:"attack",rarity:"starter",cost:1,text:"Inflige 3 dégâts.",effects:[{kind:"damage",amount:3}],targeting:"enemy",flavor:"Premier sort appris à la Tour. Premier sourcil brûlé aussi."},{id:"wizard.frostWard",name:"Égide de givre",type:"skill",rarity:"starter",cost:1,text:"Gagne 3 d’armure. Pioche 1 carte.",effects:[{kind:"block",amount:3},{kind:"draw",amount:1}],targeting:"self",flavor:"Une robe de soie, une peau de glace. Le maître d’armes n’en revient pas."},{id:"wizard.apprentice",name:"Apprenti de l’Académie",type:"minion",rarity:"starter",cost:1,text:"Dégâts des sorts +1.",effects:[],targeting:"none",minion:{attack:2,health:2,spellDamage:1},flavor:"Il vise le bandit. Il touche le bandit. Il est le premier surpris."},{id:"wizard.emberFamiliar",name:"Familier de braise",type:"minion",rarity:"starter",cost:2,text:"Provocation.",effects:[],targeting:"none",minion:{attack:2,health:4,keywords:["taunt"]},flavor:"Une salamandre de poche. Ne pas ranger dans la bibliothèque."},{id:"wizard.mirrorImage",name:"Mirages d’Avalon",type:"skill",rarity:"common",cost:1,text:"Invoque deux Reflets 0/2 avec Provocation.",effects:[{kind:"summon",card:"token.wizardReflection"},{kind:"summon",card:"token.wizardReflection"}],targeting:"self",flavor:"Trois Thaumaturges. Le Saxon frappe celle qui sourit. Mauvais choix."},{id:"wizard.sparks",name:"Gerbe d’étincelles",type:"attack",rarity:"common",cost:2,text:"Inflige 1 dégât à un ennemi aléatoire quatre fois.",effects:[{kind:"damageRandom",amount:1,hits:4}],targeting:"none",flavor:"Les flammes se propagent. Surtout là où on ne les attendait pas."},{id:"wizard.iceLance",name:"Lance de glace",type:"attack",rarity:"common",cost:2,text:"Inflige 3 dégâts à un ennemi et le Gèle.",effects:[{kind:"damage",amount:3},{kind:"freeze"}],targeting:"enemy",flavor:"Le froid ne tue pas toujours. Il rend juste tout le reste plus facile."},{id:"wizard.ignite",name:"Pyromancienne",type:"minion",rarity:"common",cost:2,text:"Cri de guerre : inflige 2 dégâts à un ennemi aléatoire.",effects:[],targeting:"none",minion:{attack:2,health:3,battlecry:[{kind:"damageRandom",amount:2}]},flavor:"Elle claque des doigts. L’ennemi, lui, ne claque plus rien."},{id:"wizard.runeAdept",name:"Adepte de la Terre",type:"minion",rarity:"common",cost:2,text:"Cri de guerre : Découverte d’un sort.",effects:[],targeting:"none",minion:{attack:2,health:3,battlecry:[{kind:"discover",pool:"spell"}]},flavor:"Elle parle aux menhirs de Badon. Parfois, ils lui répondent en tombant sur l’ennemi."},{id:"wizard.arcaneIntellect",name:"Érudite de l’Académie",type:"minion",rarity:"common",cost:3,text:"Cri de guerre : pioche 1 carte.",effects:[],targeting:"none",minion:{attack:3,health:4,battlecry:[{kind:"draw",amount:1}]},flavor:"La bibliothèque d’Avalon compte dix mille grimoires. Elle en a lu trois. Bien."},{id:"wizard.stoneGolem",name:"Golem de l’Académie",type:"minion",rarity:"common",cost:3,text:"Provocation.",effects:[],targeting:"none",minion:{attack:3,health:5,keywords:["taunt"]},flavor:"Animé pour garder la porte. Il a oublié qu’il pouvait l’ouvrir."},{id:"wizard.fireball",name:"Boule de feu",type:"attack",rarity:"common",cost:4,text:"Inflige 6 dégâts.",effects:[{kind:"damage",amount:6}],targeting:"enemy",flavor:"La réponse classique de Logres à toutes les questions."},{id:"wizard.frostElemental",name:"Élémentaire de givre",type:"minion",rarity:"common",cost:4,text:"Cri de guerre : Gèle un ennemi.",effects:[],targeting:"enemy",minion:{attack:4,health:6,battlecry:[{kind:"freeze"}]},flavor:"Un hiver entier, plié dans une silhouette. Il fond de rage."},{id:"wizard.fireElemental",name:"Élémentaire de feu",type:"minion",rarity:"common",cost:6,text:"Cri de guerre : inflige 3 dégâts.",effects:[],targeting:"enemy",minion:{attack:6,health:7,battlecry:[{kind:"damage",amount:3}]},flavor:"Invoqué dans l’âtre de la Tour. Le ramoneur a démissionné."},{id:"wizard.frostAcolyte",name:"Acolyte du givre",type:"minion",rarity:"common",cost:2,text:"Cri de guerre : Gèle un ennemi.",effects:[],targeting:"enemy",minion:{attack:3,health:2,battlecry:[{kind:"freeze"}]},flavor:"Elle ne sait geler que les gens. L’hydromel de la Tour reste tiède. Le maître s’impatiente."},{id:"wizard.willOWisp",name:"Feu follet d’Avalon",type:"minion",rarity:"common",cost:3,text:"Râle d’agonie : inflige 2 dégâts à un ennemi aléatoire.",effects:[],targeting:"none",minion:{attack:3,health:3,deathrattle:[{kind:"damageRandom",amount:2}]},flavor:"Il guide les voyageurs égarés dans les marais d’Avalon. Droit dans la tourbière."},{id:"wizard.coneOfCold",name:"Bise d’Ynys Wydrin",type:"attack",rarity:"common",cost:3,text:"Inflige 2 dégâts à un serviteur ennemi. Gèle tous les serviteurs ennemis.",effects:[{kind:"damage",amount:2},{kind:"freeze",target:"enemyMinions"}],targeting:"enemyMinion",flavor:"Un souffle glacé en éventail. Les gobelins d’Ynys Wydrin ont perdu le sourire, et les orteils."},{id:"wizard.frostTrap",name:"Piège de givre",type:"skill",rarity:"uncommon",cost:2,text:"Secret : quand un ennemi attaque, Gèle-le. Gagne 4 d’armure.",effects:[],targeting:"self",secret:{trigger:"attacked",effects:[{kind:"freeze"},{kind:"block",amount:4}]},flavor:"Le Saxon lève sa hache. Il la baissera au printemps."},{id:"wizard.flameWard",name:"Sceau de combustion",type:"skill",rarity:"u