wstring, both streaking toward an enemy, motion blur","ranger.thornTrap":"thorny glowing brambles bursting from the forest floor and binding a brigand’s legs, green magic","ranger.elfArcher":"an elegant elf archer woman drawing a silver longbow on a forest ridge at dawn, hair blowing","ranger.ambush":"elf rangers leaping out of tall ferns to ambush surprised soldiers on a forest road","ranger.forestStalker":"a hooded elf stalker sprinting through a dark forest with a drawn blade, glowing green eyes","ranger.yewBow":"an ornate yew longbow carved with celtic knots and silver inlay, resting against a standing stone","ranger.druidsWisdom":"an old Hibernian druid handing a bundle of glowing arrows to a young elf ranger in a sacred grove","ranger.arrowRain":"a dense rain of arrows falling over a misty valley lake, elf archers on the hills around it","ranger.rangersInstinct":"close-up of an elf ranger’s sharp eyes in the shadow of a hood, leaves and wind around, tension","ranger.greatStag":"a majestic giant white stag with moss-covered antlers charging across a green Hibernian glen","ranger.shadowArcher":"a shadowy elf archer half hidden in darkness among the trees, two glowing arrows nocked","ranger.arrowStorm":"a storm of thousands of arrows blotting out the sun above a Hibernian battlefield, warriors of the Fianna","ranger.fragarach":"Fragarach, the legendary celtic sword of Manannan, glowing sea-green blade floating above crashing waves","ranger.lugh":"Lugh of the Long Arm, radiant celtic sun god archer with a golden spear and bow, shining armour, sunrise","ranger.markingArrow":"a single arrow with a bright green fletching striking an oak trunk beside a startled brigand, glowing marker rune","ranger.trackPrey":"an elf ranger kneeling on a forest path studying fresh hoof prints and a broken twig, morning mist","ranger.wolfhound":"a huge shaggy grey Irish wolfhound bounding through ferns in a Hibernian forest, celtic collar, eager eyes","ranger.mistwoodGuard":"a tall elf