g violet eyes standing guard obediently beside a hooded sorcerer, dark forest road","sorcerer.shade":"a shadowy humanoid simulacrum made of black smoke and violet eyes rising from a sorcerer’s circle","sorcerer.mesmerize":"a soldier frozen in a trance staring at a swirling violet hypnotic orb held by a sorcerer","sorcerer.lifeDrain":"red streams of life essence flowing from a struggling warrior into a sorcerer’s outstretched hand","sorcerer.wither":"a warrior’s arm blackening with a glowing purple disease as a sorcerer points at him, dark crypt","sorcerer.mindBlast":"a blast of violet psychic energy exploding from a sorcerer’s forehead, throwing enemies back","sorcerer.charmedOgre":"a huge dim-witted ogre with glowing violet eyes carrying a stack of grimoires behind a sorcerer","sorcerer.polymorph":"a black knight transforming into a small green toad in a burst of violet sparkles, his armour falling","sorcerer.nightmareWeaver":"a tall gaunt nightmare creature weaving threads of dark dreams over sleeping soldiers at night","sorcerer.silence":"an enemy mage clutching his throat as a violet seal of silence glows over his mouth","sorcerer.domination":"a sorcerer on a dark throne holding glowing violet strings attached to kneeling puppet warriors","sorcerer.boundGiant":"a towering hill giant bound by glowing violet rune chains at the neck, obeying a tiny sorcerer","sorcerer.massMesmerize":"an entire army standing frozen in a trance on a misty field, violet spirals in their eyes","sorcerer.netherHorror":"a hulking horned red-skinned demon of Darkness Falls bursting from a violet portal in a hellish dungeon, chained by a hooded Albion sorcerer","sorcerer.valleyOfNoReturn":"Merlin’s Staff, the legendary power relic of Albion: an ancient gnarled oak staff crowned with a glowing violet crystal floating above a stone altar in a keep, frozen enemy knights and violet mist swirling around it","sorcerer.morgause":"Morgause, queen of Orkney, dark sorceress in a crown and black and violet gown casting a spell of frost and shadow","sorcerer.mindLeech":"a fat translucent violet leech with glowing runes latched onto a sleeping soldier’s temple, misty Avalon marsh at dusk","sorcerer.academyAdept":"a young hooded apprentice sorcerer in violet robes reading a floating grimoire, candlelit Camelot academy library","sorcerer.enthralledSquire":"a young squire in a tabard with glowing violet eyes raising a shield obediently before a hooded sorcerer","sorcerer.dreamThief":"a thin shadowy thief pulling a glowing violet thread of dreams out of a sleeping mage’s ear, moonlit chamber","sorcerer.skullStaff":"a gnarled black staff topped with a grinning skull with violet glowing eye sockets, wisps of red life essence","sorcerer.thoughtTheft":"a sorcerer plucking a glowing violet rune of thought from the head of a confused Norse mage, snowy ruins","sorcerer.mindTrap":"an axe-wielding barbarian frozen mid-swing inside a violet web of runes before a calm hooded sorcerer","sorcerer.lyonesseSpecter":"a drowned ghostly knight dripping seawater with violet glowing eyes rising from sunken Lyonesse ruins","sorcerer.mindShackle":"a proud elven champion stepping forward with violet spectral shackles closing around his wrists and mouth","sorcerer.thrallMaster":"a tall gaunt sorcerer lord raising his hand as a line of violet-eyed thralls and soldiers kneel in ranks","sorcerer.heartStop":"a sorcerer clenching his fist around a glowing violet spectral heart as a knight collapses, dark chapel","sorcerer.soulDrinker":"a hunched pale spectral creature inhaling streams of violet soul light from fallen warriors, foggy graveyard","sorcerer.charmedTemplar":"a stern Albion templar in white and red surcoat with glowing violet eyes raising a tower shield before a hooded sorcerer","sorcerer.confusion":"a dazed knight spinning in place with swirling violet hypnotic mist and dizzy sparkles circling his helmet, misty Camelot courtyard","sorcerer.mindPlague":"a wave of sickly violet psychic