strel singing a mighty song before a cavalry charge, knights glowing with red and gold power, dramatic sky","minstrel.masterMinstrel":"an old master minstrel of Camelot with a white beard and a golden harp teaching young jugglers in a castle hall","minstrel.seneschal":"the stern seneschal of Caerleon in rich robes raising a golden staff in a throne hall, everyone frozen in silence","minstrel.cantorSword":"an ornate longsword with a hilt shaped like a golden harp, strings glowing, frost and light rippling along the blade","minstrel.avalonLullaby":"a minstrel singing a lullaby by the misty lake of Avalon, enemies and even the mist falling asleep, moonlight","minstrel.swanSong":"a dying minstrel singing a radiant swan song on a battlefield, a white swan of light spreading its wings, foes falling","minstrel.brangien":"Brangien, the handmaiden of Iseult, pouring a glowing pink love potion from a silver flask into a goblet, ship cabin, candlelight","minstrel.dinadan":"Sir Dinadan, the jesting knight of the Round Table, laughing and singing a mocking song with a lute while knights scowl","minstrel.iseut":"Iseult the Fair, golden-haired Irish princess healer in a white and green gown, healing light flowing from her hands, Cornish castle","minstrel.telynTeirtu":"the enchanted harp of Teirtu, an ornate golden celtic harp playing itself in a stone hall, glowing magical strings and floating notes","minstrel.taliesin":"Taliesin, prince of bards, radiant young Welsh bard with a shining brow holding a harp, three glowing drops from the cauldron of Ceridwen","minstrel.tristan":"Sir Tristan of Lyonesse, harpist knight in blue and gold armour with a harp on his back and a sword, beside the sea and a sunken kingdom"}}},ml={id:"shaman",name:"Chaman",nameEn:"Shaman",realm:"midgard",hp:34,startingRelic:"bone_flute",hook:"Esprits et maladies : totems immobiles qui soignent ou empoisonnent chaque tour, pestes qui rongent le camp adverse et malédictions.",heroPower:{id:"shamanTotem",name:"T