ne or the Völva, or unlock it for 400 Gold in “Upgrades”."},voice:{voiceId:"N2lVS1w4EtoT3dr4eOWO",start:["The runes have spoken. You will fall.","Les runes ont parlé. Tu vas tomber."],victory:["As it was carved, so it is.","Comme c’était gravé, ainsi soit-il."],lowHp:["Odin... lend me your eye!","Odin… prête-moi ton œil !"]},art:{subject:"Midgard runemaster: old norse male priest of Odin with a long grey braided beard and an eyepatch, dark blue hooded robes with fur trim, an ash wood runestaff carved with glowing blue runes, floating rune stones around his free hand",kind:"caster",noClips:!0,seed:552,portraitSeed:1852,cardSeed:5100,cards:{"runemaster.runeBolt":"a norse priest tracing a glowing blue rune in the air with one finger, the rune turning into a blade of light flying at an enemy, snowy night","runemaster.algiz":"a glowing Algiz rune shaped like elk antlers forming a protective blue shield around a norse priest, snowy pine forest","runemaster.acolyte":"a young norse acolyte of Odin with one eye shut and a blindfold, studying rune stones by a fire in a wooden temple","runemaster.runeCutter":"a norse rune cutter chiselling glowing runes into a standing stone, sparks and blue light, snowy Midgard hillside","runemaster.sowilo":"a small glowing golden Sowilo sun rune spark flying from a norse priest hand, lighting the dark, aurora sky","runemaster.isa":"a straight icy Isa rune glowing on a frozen warrior who is stuck in place, frost crystals, cold blue light","runemaster.darkBolt":"a silent bolt of black darkness magic with violet edges shooting from a runestaff toward an enemy, snowy ruins at night","runemaster.runestone":"a tall carved runestone covered in glowing blue runes standing before the wooden gates of Jordheim, snow falling","runemaster.seeress":"a norse seeress casting rune stones onto a wolf pelt by candlelight, a raven watching, wooden longhouse interior","runemaster.runeWarden":"a norse warden in blue robes guarding a circle of standing rune stones