dborg":"three norse warriors locking shields to hold a narrow wooden bridge against a horde, river","warrior.masterRiposte":"a norse weapon master sidestepping a charging beast and cutting it down with one perfect stroke","warrior.thingChampion":"a norse champion standing in a duel circle of hazel stakes at the thing assembly, crowd watching","warrior.hervor":"Hervor the shieldmaiden standing on a burial mound at night demanding the sword from a ghostly warrior","warrior.svalinn":"Svalinn, a colossal golden shield standing in front of the blazing sun, shielding the earth below","warrior.hjalmar":"Hjalmar the high-hearted, a wounded norse hero singing on a battlefield on Samso island, berserkers fallen","warrior.starkad":"Starkad the Old, a towering grizzled norse hero with many scars swinging a great sword, blood and snow","warrior.tyrfing":"Tyrfing, a cursed norse sword glowing with golden fire, dwarven runes on the blade, dark cave","warrior.vidarr":"Vidarr the silent god with a thick iron boot stepping on the jaw of the giant wolf Fenrir, Ragnarok"}}},vl={id:"mentalist",name:"Mentaliste",nameEn:"Mentalist",realm:"hibernia",hp:26,startingRelic:"mirror_shard",hook:"Mage de l’Harmonie : prends le contrôle des serviteurs ennemis, manipule le mana, soigne et pioche.",heroPower:{id:"mentalistClarity",name:"Clarté de l’esprit",text:"Rend 2 PV à un personnage allié. Pioche 1 carte.",cost:2,targeting:"friendly",effects:[{kind:"heal",amount:2,target:"target"},{kind:"draw",amount:1}]},starterDeck:["mentalist.mindSpike","mentalist.mindSpike","mentalist.mindSpike","mentalist.soothe","mentalist.soothe","mentalist.soothe","mentalist.apprentice","mentalist.apprentice","mentalist.mindReader","mentalist.mindReader"],cards:[{id:"mentalist.mindSpike",name:"Pointe mentale",type:"attack",rarity:"starter",cost:1,text:"Inflige 1 dégât. Pioche 1 carte.",effects:[{kind:"damage",amount:1},{kind:"draw",amount:1}],targeting:"enemy",flavor:"Une pensée aiguë comme une aiguille. L’ennemi grimac